{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《香港連場好戲》最新一集，孔德賢（Danny）與李海銅（Nina）去到長洲，重現多個電影經典場景，氣氛本來相當浪漫。但二人去到長洲戲院時竟突然戲癮大發，即場上演一幕經典喜劇，扮鬼扮馬的演出極之爆笑，完全拋開偶像包袱！究竟他們上演了</p>\n<p>\nTVB節目《香港連場好戲》最新一集，曾展望（GM）與葉蒨文（Sophie）現身中西區重演韓劇浪漫，重現多個影視作品電影經典場景，氣氛本來相當浪漫。另一方孔德賢與李海銅去到長洲戲院時竟突然戲癮大發，即場上演一幕經典喜劇，扮鬼扮馬的演出極之爆笑，完全拋開偶像包袱！究竟他們上演了哪一齣戲，火花四濺的互動有多搞笑？\n</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>曾展望葉蒨文接力放閃 太子台上演甜蜜捉弄</h2>\n<p>今集曾展望（GM）與葉蒨文（Sophie）則去到中西區的太子台，這裡是韓劇《瑞草洞》男女主角共享浪漫的地方。GM與Sophie亦趁機甜蜜拍拖，GM更從後突襲捉弄Sophie，嚇得Sophie一度彈起，但隨即又忍不住甜笑，二人打情罵俏，笑到見牙唔見眼，畫面充滿粉紅泡泡，甜蜜程度滿分。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_12344441256b0117dae88e2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_12344441256b0117dae88e2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_4404162656b0117e220889.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_4404162656b0117e220889.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_12704223956b0117e77042d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_12704223956b0117e77042d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_3244769916b0117edddd2d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_3244769916b0117edddd2d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_2172068696b0117f624c80.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_2172068696b0117f624c80.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民大讚有火花：「呢對CP我嗑！」</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，孔德賢與李海銅的搞笑互動成為網民熱話，不少人大讚二人有潛質做喜劇演員。網民紛紛留言：「孔德賢同李海銅好襯！《唐伯虎點秋香》嗰段笑到我肚痛！」、「求TVB開古裝劇俾佢哋兩個！太有喜感！」、「呢對CP我嗑！互動好自然好可愛！」、「GM同Sophie都好sweet，成集都係粉紅泡泡。」、「呢個節目好正，可以跟住佢哋去打卡，又可以睇到明星搞笑嘅一面。」</p>\n<h2>長洲戲院大暴走 孔德賢李海銅變身古人</h2>\n<p>今集另一焦點落在孔德賢與李海銅的長洲之旅，二人在充滿懷舊氣息的長洲戲院內，突然戲癮大發，即興上演周星馳經典電影《唐伯虎點秋香》的橋段。孔德賢化身風流才子，對著李海銅深情地說：「你咪係秋香妹」，而李海銅亦非常入戲，嬌俏回應：「你都冇解嘅」。二人你一言我一語，最後孔德賢更搞笑地提議：「既然我哋都咁有緣，不如拍個照留念呢？」，兩人扮鬼扮馬，互動充滿火花，場面極度搞笑。</p>\n<h2>重現菲國電影場景 坐海旁大玩浪漫</h2>\n<p>在上演爆笑喜劇前，孔德賢與李海銅其實正沉浸在浪漫氣氛中。他們此行的任務是重現菲律賓賣座電影《你好,愛,再見》的取景地，特意走到長洲海旁，模仿戲中男女主角傾偈的經典畫面。兩人並肩而坐，在海風的吹拂下，呈現出戲中男女主角在長洲的悠閒生活感，畫面唯美又浪漫，與之後在戲院的瘋狂形成強烈對比。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_10325382876b0117a3e748e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_10325382876b0117a3e748e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_10397833436b0117a8dbef4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_10397833436b0117a8dbef4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_5677590486b0117ae17082.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_5677590486b0117ae17082.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14079861456b0117b3147b5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14079861456b0117b3147b5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14076516846b0117b8491fd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_14076516846b0117b8491fd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_15753380396b0117bdd2e2a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_15753380396b0117bdd2e2a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_18911328296b0117c42585d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_18911328296b0117c42585d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_9095217166b0117cac7fd5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_9095217166b0117cac7fd5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T10:03:50.842434+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1355,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:35:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T10:57:26.295164+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:57:23.188967+00:00","content_hash":"eb1a77a432cf68f44d4172e821cf199a5c18dcc835a237fef90ed59c314e4a1e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}